SEND 2 + 3 * 4 TO DISPLAY
SEND (2 + 3) * 4 TO DISPLAY
SEND 10 - 3 - 2 TO DISPLAY
SEND 100 / 10 / 2 TO DISPLAY
SEND 2 * 3 MOD 4 TO DISPLAY
SEND 17 MOD 5 * 2 TO DISPLAY
SEND 7 DIV 2 * 2 TO DISPLAY
SEND -3 ^ 2 TO DISPLAY
SEND 2 * -3 TO DISPLAY
SEND 'a' & 1 + 2 TO DISPLAY
SEND 1 + 2 = 3 TO DISPLAY
SEND NOT 1 = 2 TO DISPLAY
SEND NOT TRUE AND FALSE TO DISPLAY
SEND NOT TRUE OR TRUE TO DISPLAY
SEND TRUE OR FALSE AND FALSE TO DISPLAY
SEND 'x' & 2 ^ 2 TO DISPLAY
